 'Exploring Shadow Valley's Burn Scars'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Explore the burn scar near Darius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n> **Quest Text:** Daerius Jaegir is investigating the burn scars in Shadow Valley. He has asked for assitance in learning more about what happened here. He thinks an intense battle took place and wants to understand what happened.\n>\n> Explore Shadow Velley for burn scar locations. Hunt shadows for any relics they may have found.\nThis update is right near Darius at /waypoint -176, -1384, 4\nP 1384.8889, 176.5170, -0.3557, 0, 0, 0, 3, Update\\_1\\_Burn\\_Scars\n2\\. Explore the burn scar to the West 0/1 Shadow Valley\nThis update is at /waypoint -221, -122, 5\nP 122.4476, 221.1480, 0.8102, 0, 0, 0, 3, Update\\_2\\_Burn\\_Scars\n3\\. Explore the burn scar North West 0/1 Shadow Valley\nThis update is at /waypoint 168, 559, 26\nP -559.6478, -168.1006, 21.8169, 0, 0, 0, 3, Update\\_3\\_Burns\\_Scars\n4\\. Explore the burn scar furthest West 0/1 Shadow Valley\nThis update is at /waypoint -359, 268, 35\nP -268.7544, 359.1271, 31.4603, 0, 0, 0, 3, Update\\_4\\_Burns\\_Scars\n5\\. Collect a relic from a defensive shadow 0/1 Shadow Valley\nCollect a Chipped Axe Head [item=142734] (can be prelooted) from a defensive shadow [npc=56917].\n6\\. Collect a relic from a vengeful shadow 0/1 Shadow Valley\nCollect a Melted Sword Hilt [item=142735] (can be prelooted) from a vengeful shadow [npc=56937].\n7\\. Collect a relic from an avenging shadow 0/1 Shadow Valley\nCollect a Matted Bear Helm [item=142736] (can be prelooted) from an avenging shadow [npc=56946].\n8\\. Collect a relic from an avenging mass 0/1 Shadow Valley\nCollect a Brittle Half Shield [item=142737] (can be prelooted) from an avenging mass [npc=56945].\n9\\. Return the Chipped Axe Head to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n10\\. Return the Melted Sword Hilt to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n11\\. Return the Matted Bear Helm to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n12\\. Return the Brittle Half Shield to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\nGive the 4 relics to Istoph Banock [npc=56955] at the barbarian camp (she's on Find).\n13\\. Speak with Daerius Jaegir about [the relics] 0/1 Shadow Valley\nYou say, 'relics'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Interesting. These remains remind me of [Barbarian weapons].\nYou say, 'Tell me more about the Barbarian weapons.'\nYou have been given: Sack of Barbarian Relics [item=142739]\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Here take these items to the [small encampment] and see of anyone recognizes them.'\nYou say, 'What small encampment?'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'To the west of here you will find a hill with a slope that can be climbed. Follow the bridges to the north, you should eventually find the camp. Perhaps you can ask a few of them what they know about the history of this land.'\n14\\. Show the relics to someone who knows about them 0/1 Shadow Valley\n> Show the relics to the Barbarians at the encampment and find out what they know about them.\n15\\. Speak with Istoph Banock about [these relics] 0/1 Shadow Valley\nIstoph Banock says, 'Where did you find [these relics]?'\nYou say, 'I found these relics near the burn scars and I am trying to find out more information about them. I couldn't tell how they got there.'\nIstoph Banock says, 'These relics the [chipped axe head], the [melted sword hilt], the [brittle half shield], and the [matted bear helm] belonged to mighty warriors of Halas.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about the chipped axe head.'\nIstoph Banock says, 'This chipped axe head used to belong to a strong warrior of Halas. You can tell by this etching; its owner had seen many battles.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about the melted sword hilt.'\nIstoph Banock says, 'This melted sword hilt is odd. The blade is missing, but the handle still exists. Perhaps the blade was in the molten ground. The pommel resembles a wolfs head.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about the brittle half shield.'\nIstoph Banock says, 'This piece, this brittle half shield, was once much larger. Look at how it flakes to the touch. It's as if it has seen too many seasons. The wood and metal design remind me of those used by [Wolves of the North].'\nYou say, 'Tell me about the matted bear helm.'\nIstoph Banock says, 'And this matted bear helm, I see what remains of the beaded work along the edges? It belonged to a seasoned warrior of the Tribunal.'\nYou say, ' All of these seem related to the Wolves of the North.'\nYou have been given: Relic Report [item=142746]\nYour task 'Exploring Shadow Valley's Burn Scars' has been updated.\nIstoph Banock sighs. 'Aye, they belonged to family that is missing. Knowing the state of these does not bode well for them. It may be time to head home. Here, you can have this. It's a list of the items and what they were. However, I will be keeping these relics and giving them back to the families that they belong to.'\n16\\. Return the Relic Report to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\nDaerius seems intrigued by the information that you brought back to him. He needs time to investigate and study this new information.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nYou receive 354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
