d damage suggest fire, but the fulgurite formations suggest lightning. Who did this? Was it [Lizenael Methinon]? How long has it been here? Why have [the inhabitants] left the scars mostly alone? You would think that they would want everything to go back to normal.'\nYou say, 'Who is Lizenael Methinon?'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Methinon is a fellow wizard. He went missing a while ago, and I`m trying to track him down.'\nYou say, 'The inhabitants don't seem to be that observant.'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'These creatures are not conventional, they are territorial and have no need of subsistence. They seem to exist just to maintain this territory. They should be laboring to return this barren valley to a state prior to any [intrusion].'\nYou say, 'What intrusion?'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Catching Lightning'.\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Well obviously, Methinon sent people here to investigate this land. It`s apparent that the investigation did not go as planned. I would even speculate that they have been repelled or eliminated. Can you [hunt some] of the creatures and see what they have been getting into. Maybe I will learn what is repelling them.'\n\n---\n\n1\\. Collect a fulgurite sample from a lurker 0/1 Shadow Valley\n2\\. Collect a fulgurite sample from a beetle 0/1 Shadow Valley\n3\\. Collect a fulgurite sample from a swarm 0/1 Shadow Valley\n4\\. Collect a fulgurite sample from a grim lahar 0/1 Shadow Valley\n5\\. Return the Charred Umbral Fulgurite to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n6\\. Return the Crystallized Umbral Fulgurite to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n7\\. Return the Scorched Umbral Fulgurite to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n8\\. Return the Fossilized Umbral Fulgurite to Daerius 0/1 Shadow Valley\n9\\. Talk to Daerius Jaegir about [the Fulgurites] 0/1 Shadow Valley\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nMoney for your level\nExperience for your level\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
