around!'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Yes, they have an interesting effect. The shadows mixed with this power. It [really want]s to keep its secret.'\nYou say, 'How can rocks really want anything?'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Look where you stand. This land belongs to one goddess and she holds [dominion] over all you see.'\nYou say, 'She does not have dominion over me.'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Indeed. And perhaps over some of the other creatures here. There are shadow wolves [npc=56933] to the west of here, that may also have been altered. I believe these unfortunate creatures were lost in this land and changed by their experiences here. Bring me any clues of their alteration and we may get to the bottom of this mystery.'\n2\\. Hunt Shadow Wolves for proof of deception 0/6 (Shadow Valley)\n3\\. Loot the Shadowed Subjugation Collars 0/6 (Shadow Valley)\nShadowed Subjugation Collar [item=142747] drops off a shadow wolf [npc=56933] and an umbra wolf [npc=56913]. They CANNOT be prelooted.\n4\\. Return Shadowed Subjugation Collars to Daerius 0/6 (Shadow Valley)\n5\\. Walk with Daerius Jaegir about [the collars] 0/1 (Shadow Valley)\nYou say, 'the collars'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'You can feel the power emanating from these collars. There is a formidable resolve here. I am curious about the other creatures you have [come across]?'\nYou say, 'I have come across grim shades and drifting shadows.'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Do you think any of them [could have] put those collars on the wolves?'\nYou say, 'I think they both could have been capable of doing it.'\nDaerius Jaegir says, 'Maybe I should [go look] into their abilities.'\nYou say, 'I can go look for you, since you're so busy.'\n6\\. Collect the Residue of Shadow 0/6 (Shadow Valley)\nResidue of Shadow [item=142743] drops off grim shades and drifting shadows. They can be prelooted.\n7\\. Return the Residue of Shadow to Daerius 0/6 (Shadow Valley)\n8\\. Talk with Daerius Jaegir about [the residue] 0/1 (Shadow Valley)\n9\\. Defeat the shade assassin 0/1 (Shadow Valley)\n_Protect yourself from the shaded assassin._\nAn NPC called \"a shaded assassin\" will spawn and charge you at this state. This NPC spawns just a bit NW of Daerius. It only spawned for me when everyone in the group was at this part of the task. The whole group will get credit.\n10\\. Talk with Daerius Jaegir about the [shaded assassin] 0/1 (Shadow Valley)\n_Talk with Daerius Jaegir about what the assassin means._\nReward(s):\n354 platinum 1 gold 6 silver 7 copper\nYou gain experience!\n- Platinum, Experience",
